From the above calculations, we can conclude to reject the null hypothesis that these are normally distirbuted. Since Overall Life, Male Life and Female Life have normal bell curves that show relevancy, we also know that the Continent is part of the important features. However, Female Life is closest to correlation with Overall Life instead of Male Life, so Female Life will be a secondary relevant feature also. Concluding, Overall Life and the Continent will be the features used to get to the target variable.

